#. liveCampusEvents.crosswind.title
#: src/data/live-campus.js:33
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.crosswind.title"
msgid "Tengu windways are running an unannounced crosswind trial"
msgstr "天狗風路、予告なしの横風試験中"

#. liveCampusEvents.crosswind.body
#: src/data/live-campus.js:34
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.crosswind.body"
msgid ""
"Broom airways are paused. Tengu Express still runs, although every flag "
"claims to be a tailwind."
msgstr "箒空路は停止。天狗急行は運行中だが、すべての旗が自分を追い風だと主張している。"

#. liveCampusEvents.crosswind.rule
#: src/data/live-campus.js:35
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.crosswind.rule"
msgid "Broom network closed; add 2 minutes to tengu windways"
msgstr "箒網停止・天狗風路は2分増"

#. liveCampusEvents.kappaTape.title
#: src/data/live-campus.js:42
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.kappaTape.title"
msgid "Waterfall Supply Line returns to “permanent temporary repair”"
msgstr "滝資材線、再び「恒久的仮修理」へ"

#. liveCampusEvents.kappaTape.body
#: src/data/live-campus.js:43
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.kappaTape.body"
msgid ""
"The Seven-Day–Kappa direct segment is closed. Changing tape from blue to red "
"does not constitute inspection."
msgstr "七曜塔―河童工房の直通区間を閉鎖。テープが青から赤へ変わっても検収にはならない。"

#. liveCampusEvents.kappaTape.rule
#: src/data/live-campus.js:44
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.kappaTape.rule"
msgid "Seven-Day–Kappa direct link closed"
msgstr "七曜塔―河童工房直通閉鎖"

#. liveCampusEvents.bambooMist.title
#: src/data/live-campus.js:50
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.bambooMist.title"
msgid "Bamboo mist has arranged three signs into a review committee"
msgstr "迷いの竹林の霧、三標識を評議会に配置"

#. liveCampusEvents.bambooMist.body
#: src/data/live-campus.js:51
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.bambooMist.body"
msgid ""
"All ground routes through Eientei gain seven minutes. The minority opinion "
"points to yesterday and is tabled."
msgstr "永遠亭経由の地上経路は7分増。少数意見は昨日を指すため保留。"

#. liveCampusEvents.bambooMist.rule
#: src/data/live-campus.js:52
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.bambooMist.rule"
msgid "Add 7 minutes to ground links through Eientei"
msgstr "永遠亭地上区間は7分増"

#. liveCampusEvents.danmakuPractical.title
#: src/data/live-campus.js:63
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.danmakuPractical.title"
msgid "Make-up danmaku practical above Boundary Hall"
msgstr "境界講堂上空で追試弾幕実習"

#. liveCampusEvents.danmakuPractical.body
#: src/data/live-campus.js:64
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.danmakuPractical.body"
msgid ""
"Roof berthing is cancelled until the end of this period. Walking access "
"remains open; do not write answers on dodge paths."
msgstr "講堂屋上の駐機は本時限終了まで停止。徒歩入口は開放、回避経路へ解答を書かないこと。"

#. liveCampusEvents.danmakuPractical.rule
#: src/data/live-campus.js:65
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.danmakuPractical.rule"
msgid "Air links through Boundary Hall closed"
msgstr "境界講堂経由の空路停止"

#. liveCampusEvents.bookFlock.title
#: src/data/live-campus.js:71
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.bookFlock.title"
msgid "Misty Lake North Wing is counting returning holdings"
msgstr "霧の湖北翼、帰航資料を点呼中"

#. liveCampusEvents.bookFlock.body
#: src/data/live-campus.js:72
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.bookFlock.body"
msgid ""
"Two reading rooms are temporary landing buffers. Staff promise the room "
"finder is slightly more reliable than the flock."
msgstr "閲覧室二室を着陸緩衝区へ転用。司書は空室検索の方が本の群れより少し信頼できると保証。"

#. liveCampusEvents.bookFlock.rule
#: src/data/live-campus.js:73
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.bookFlock.rule"
msgid "Misty Lake reading capacity reduced by 18"
msgstr "霧の湖閲覧席を18席減"

#. liveCampusEvents.faithProcession.title
#: src/data/live-campus.js:79
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.faithProcession.title"
msgid "Three faith processions filed for the same “only true gate”"
msgstr "三信仰行列、同じ「唯一の正門」を同時申請"

#. liveCampusEvents.faithProcession.body
#: src/data/live-campus.js:80
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.faithProcession.body"
msgid ""
"Hakurei Gate–Boundary Hall is one-way on foot. Kanako, Byakuren, and Miko "
"will yield until someone else withdraws."
msgstr "博麗門―境界講堂は一方通行。神奈子・白蓮・神子は相手が撤回するまで譲ると表明。"

#. liveCampusEvents.faithProcession.rule
#: src/data/live-campus.js:81
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.faithProcession.rule"
msgid "Add 4 minutes to Gate–Boundary walking"
msgstr "正門―境界講堂徒歩は4分増"

#. liveCampusEvents.nightSparrow.title
#: src/data/live-campus.js:87
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.nightSparrow.title"
msgid "The night sparrow opened supper early and denies any link to rehearsal"
msgstr "夜雀、夜食窓口を前倒し。稽古との関係は否定"

#. liveCampusEvents.nightSparrow.body
#: src/data/live-campus.js:88
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.nightSparrow.body"
msgid ""
"Lamprey and plum rice balls are served from dusk. Singing volume is not "
"nutritional information."
msgstr "八目鰻と梅おにぎりは本日夕刻から。歌唱音量は栄養表示に含まれない。"

#. liveCampusEvents.nightSparrow.rule
#: src/data/live-campus.js:89
msgctxt "text:liveCampusEvents.nightSparrow.rule"
msgid "Supper opens 40 minutes early"
msgstr "夜食窓口を40分前倒し"

#. liveCampusSnapshot.weather.0
#: src/data/live-campus.js:152
msgctxt "text:liveCampusSnapshot.weather.0"
msgid "Light mist · steady lake wind"
msgstr "薄霧・湖風安定"

#. liveCampusSnapshot.weather.1
#: src/data/live-campus.js:153
msgctxt "text:liveCampusSnapshot.weather.1"
msgid "Mountain gusts · secure loose papers"
msgstr "山側突風・紙を固定"

#. liveCampusSnapshot.weather.2
#: src/data/live-campus.js:154
msgctxt "text:liveCampusSnapshot.weather.2"
msgid "Bamboo humidity · signs bleeding"
msgstr "竹林湿気・標識の墨にじみ"

#. liveCampusSnapshot.weather.3
#: src/data/live-campus.js:155
msgctxt "text:liveCampusSnapshot.weather.3"
msgid "Sunny intervals · fairy-local rain"
msgstr "晴れ間・妖精性局地雨"

#. note
#: src/data/live-campus.js:188
msgctxt "text:note"
msgid "Operating by the ordinary bell schedule"
msgstr "校鐘どおり通常開館"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:193
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus"
msgid "North Wing is a landing buffer for returning holdings"
msgstr "北翼を帰航資料の緩衝区へ転用"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:197
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.2"
msgid "Roof make-up practical; front rows are exit lanes"
msgstr "屋上追試のため前二列を退避路へ"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:201
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.3"
msgid "Full-moon archive cabinets take early attendance"
msgstr "満月書庫は早めに点呼"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:205
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.4"
msgid "Upper windows closed; two laboratories are load-limited"
msgstr "高層窓を閉鎖、実験室二室を減載"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:210
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.5"
msgid "Direct link repair; half the benches are holding tape down"
msgstr "直通線修理、作業台半数はテープの重し"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:214
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.6"
msgid "Eight seats serve wet-book quarantine and paperweight loans"
msgstr "八席を濡れ本隔離・文鎮石貸出机へ"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:218
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.7"
msgid "Six seats are fallen-leaf version comparison desks"
msgstr "六席を落葉版比較机へ"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:222
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.8"
msgid "Full-moon holdings are open; ten general seats are reassigned"
msgstr "満月可視資料を開架、一般閲覧十席減"

#. liveFacilityStatus
#: src/data/live-campus.js:227
msgctxt "text:liveFacilityStatus.9"
msgid "The laboratory reduces load early for winter seal inventory"
msgstr "冬季封印棚卸のため実験塔を早期減載"

#. mapNoticePool.0
#: src/data/live-campus.js:250
msgctxt "text:mapNoticePool.0"
msgid ""
"The donation box is temporarily Lost Property. Reimu says lost property is "
"not temporarily a donation."
msgstr "賽銭箱は一時的に遺失物箱。霊夢曰く、遺失物が賽銭の代わりになるわけではない。"

#. mapNoticePool.1
#: src/data/live-campus.js:251
msgctxt "text:mapNoticePool.1"
msgid ""
"Today’s fourth “shortcut” is eleven minutes longer. Bamboo Orienteering "
"refuses to revoke its shortcut status."
msgstr "本日四本目の「近道」は通常路より十一分長い。竹林オリエン部は近道資格の取消を拒否。"

#. mapNoticePool.2
#: src/data/live-campus.js:252
msgctxt "text:mapNoticePool.2"
msgid ""
"The rain-wrinkled campus paper is still dated tomorrow. Aya says this proves "
"only that the rain arrived early."
msgstr "雨で皺んだ学報の日付はまだ明日。文は雨が早く降った証拠にすぎないと主張。"

#. mapNoticePool.3
#: src/data/live-campus.js:253
msgctxt "text:mapNoticePool.3"
msgid "The north sign’s typo has been corrected three times. The correction date is now wrong."
msgstr "北側木札の誤字は三度訂正済み。現在誤っているのは訂正日。"

#. liveMapNotice.label
#: src/data/live-campus.js:268
msgctxt "text:liveMapNotice.label"
msgid "TODAY'S WOODEN NOTICE"
msgstr "本日の木札"

